# PalmBolo milestone 4 on the TX, with a debug build made with
# EXTRA="-DDEMO_START": the tank starts six squares west of base 0, a
# neutral base with pill 5 three squares south of it. Times are ms after
# launch and settle.
# Opens Everard Island, drives east onto the base (capturing it), and
# waits there while the pill shoots at it.
